{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-1e7b88bf-1d78-489d-8dde-6137e8a4729b-15","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"108→\t<fighter id=\"rukia\" name=\"朽木·露琪亚 义骸\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/rukia.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n110→\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/rukia.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/rukia_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/rukia_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/rukia_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>命运是轮回的吗?还是伸向前方的? | 假如,是轮回的话,那就应该把那轮回之环击碎吗?  | 还是应该逆来顺受呢?</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>人们之所以能怀抱希望，是因为他们看不见死亡。</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n120→\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"rukia_shijie\" name=\"朽木·露琪亚 始解\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/rukia.swf\" startFrame=\"2\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n130→\t\t\t<say_item>命运是轮回的吗?还是伸向前方的? | 假如,是轮回的话,那就应该把那轮回之环击碎吗?  | 还是应该逆来顺受呢?</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>人们之所以能怀抱希望，是因为他们看不见死亡。</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"renji\" name=\"阿散井·恋次\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/renji.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/renji.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/renji_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/renji_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/renji_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n140→\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>我曾经发誓，我说过我一定要救她……|并没有向谁，仅仅是向我的——灵魂而发誓！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>在触不到的燎牙上点火，就象不必仰望星星就能解决，|就象不必喊破喉咙就可以一样。</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>其实我非常害怕，虽然表面好像紧追不舍，随时可以应战了，|实际上，我却连你的影子都不敢踩……|其实，我真的很害怕……</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>索求斗争……在那之前，所渴望的是什么呢……|呜呼，今夜，再次长啸。</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n150→\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"kenpachi\" name=\"更木·剑八\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/kenpachi.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/kenpachi.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>"}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"ReadFile","FileContent":{"content":"108→\t<fighter id=\"rukia\" name=\"朽木·露琪亚 义骸\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/rukia.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n110→\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/rukia.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/rukia_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/rukia_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/rukia_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>命运是轮回的吗?还是伸向前方的? | 假如,是轮回的话,那就应该把那轮回之环击碎吗?  | 还是应该逆来顺受呢?</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>人们之所以能怀抱希望，是因为他们看不见死亡。</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n120→\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"rukia_shijie\" name=\"朽木·露琪亚 始解\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/rukia.swf\" startFrame=\"2\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n130→\t\t\t<say_item>命运是轮回的吗?还是伸向前方的? | 假如,是轮回的话,那就应该把那轮回之环击碎吗?  | 还是应该逆来顺受呢?</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>人们之所以能怀抱希望，是因为他们看不见死亡。</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"renji\" name=\"阿散井·恋次\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/renji.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/renji.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/renji_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/renji_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/renji_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n140→\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>我曾经发誓，我说过我一定要救她……|并没有向谁，仅仅是向我的——灵魂而发誓！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>在触不到的燎牙上点火，就象不必仰望星星就能解决，|就象不必喊破喉咙就可以一样。</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>其实我非常害怕，虽然表面好像紧追不舍，随时可以应战了，|实际上，我却连你的影子都不敢踩……|其实，我真的很害怕……</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>索求斗争……在那之前，所渴望的是什么呢……|呜呼，今夜，再次长啸。</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n150→\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"kenpachi\" name=\"更木·剑八\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/kenpachi.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/kenpachi.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>","content_concise":"108→\t<fighter id=\"rukia\" name=\"朽木·露琪亚 义骸\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/rukia.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n110→\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/rukia.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/rukia_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/rukia_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/rukia_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>命运是轮回的吗?还是伸向前方的? | 假如,是轮回的话,那就应该把那轮回之环击碎吗?  | 还是应该逆来顺受呢?</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>人们之所以能怀抱希望，是因为他们看不见死亡。</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n120→\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"rukia_shijie\" name=\"朽木·露琪亚 始解\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/rukia.swf\" startFrame=\"2\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n130→\t\t\t<say_item>命运是轮回的吗?还是伸向前方的? | 假如,是轮回的话,那就应该把那轮回之环击碎吗?  | 还是应该逆来顺受呢?</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>人们之所以能怀抱希望，是因为他们看不见死亡。</s