file url=\"assets/fighter/rukia.swf\" startFrame=\"2\" />\r\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/rukia_sj_w.png\" />\r\n\t\t<contact>\r\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\r\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\r\n\t\t</contact>\r\n\t\t<says>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>命运是轮回的吗?还是伸向前方的? | 假如,是轮回的话,那就应该把那轮回之环击碎吗?  | 还是应该逆来顺受呢?</say_item>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>人们之所以能怀抱希望，是因为他们看不见死亡。</say_item>\r\n\t\t</says>\r\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\r\n\t</fighter>\r\n\t\r\n\t<fighter id=\"renji\" name=\"阿散井·恋次\" comic_type=\"0\">\r\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/renji.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\r\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/renji.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/renji_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/renji_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/renji_w.png\" />\r\n\t\t<contact>\r\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\r\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\r\n\t\t</contact>\r\n\t\t<says>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>我曾经发誓，我说过我一定要救她……|并没有向谁，仅仅是向我的——灵魂而发誓！</say_item>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>在触不到的燎牙上点火，就象不必仰望星星就能解决，|就象不必喊破喉咙就可以一样。</say_item>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>其实我非常害怕，虽然表面好像紧追不舍，随时可以应战了，|实际上，我却连你的影子都不敢踩……|其实，我真的很害怕……</say_item>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>索求斗争……在那之前，所渴望的是什么呢……|呜呼，今夜，再次长啸。</say_item>\r\n\t\t</says>\r\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\r\n\t</fighter>\r\n\t\r\n\t<fighter id=\"kenpachi\" name=\"更木·剑八\" comic_type=\"0\">\r\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/kenpachi.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\r\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/kenpachi.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_w.png\" />\r\n\t\t<contact>\r\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\r\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n","total_lines":862}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-1e7b88bf-1d78-489d-8dde-6137e8a4729b-16","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"136→\t<fighter id=\"renji\" name=\"阿散井·恋次\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/renji.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/renji.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/renji_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/renji_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/renji_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n140→\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>我曾经发誓，我说过我一定要救她……|并没有向谁，仅仅是向我的——灵魂而发誓！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>在触不到的燎牙上点火，就象不必仰望星星就能解决，|就象不必喊破喉咙就可以一样。</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>其实我非常害怕，虽然表面好像紧追不舍，随时可以应战了，|实际上，我却连你的影子都不敢踩……|其实，我真的很害怕……</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>索求斗争……在那之前，所渴望的是什么呢……|呜呼，今夜，再次长啸。</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n150→\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"kenpachi\" name=\"更木·剑八\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/kenpachi.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/kenpachi.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n160→\t\t\t<say_item>来吧、厮杀吧！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>不畏惧死，为的是玩乐死亡。</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>每舍弃自尊一次，我们就越像是野兽。|每扼杀一颗心，我们就远离野兽一步。</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>我已经忘了很久了……没有名字的痛苦……|其他人都在叫对方的名字，而自己没有，那时什么感觉呢？</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"80\" />"}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"ReadFile","FileContent":{"content":"136→\t<fighter id=\"renji\" name=\"阿散井·恋次\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/renji.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/renji.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/renji_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/renji_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/renji_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n140→\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>我曾经发誓，我说过我一定要救她……|并没有向谁，仅仅是向我的——灵魂而发誓！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>在触不到的燎牙上点火，就象不必仰望星星就能解决，|就象不必喊破喉咙就可以一样。</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>其实我非常害怕，虽然表面好像紧追不舍，随时可以应战了，|实际上，我却连你的影子都不敢踩……|其实，我真的很害怕……</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>索求斗争……在那之前，所渴望的是什么呢……|呜呼，今夜，再次长啸。</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n150→\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"kenpachi\" name=\"更木·剑八\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/kenpachi.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/kenpachi.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n160→\t\t\t<say_item>来吧、厮杀吧！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>不畏惧死，为的是玩乐死亡。</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>每舍弃自尊一次，我们就越像是野兽。|每扼杀一颗心，我们就远离野兽一步。</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>我已经忘了很久了……没有名字的痛苦……|其他人都在叫对方的名字，而自己没有，那时什么感觉呢？</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"80\" />","content_concise":"136→\t<fighter id=\"renji\" name=\"阿散井·恋次\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/renji.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/renji.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/renji_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/renji_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/renji_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n140→\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>我曾经发誓，我说过我一定要救她……|并没有向谁，仅仅是向我的——灵魂而发誓！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>在触不到的燎牙上点火，就象不必仰望星星就能解决，|就象不必喊破喉咙就可以一样。</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>其实我非常害怕，虽然表面好像紧追不舍，随时可以应战了，|实际上，我却连你的影子都不敢踩……|其实，我真的很害怕……</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>索求斗争……在那之前，所渴望的是什么呢……|呜呼，今夜，再次长啸。</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n150→\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"kenpachi\" name=\"更木·剑八\" comic_type=\"0\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/kenpachi.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/kenpachi.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n160→\t\t\t<say_item>来吧、厮杀吧！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>不畏惧死，为的是玩乐死亡。</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>每舍弃自尊一次，我们就越像是野兽。|每扼杀一颗心，我们就远离野兽一步。</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>我已经忘了很久了……没有名字的痛苦……|其他人都在叫对方的名字，而自己没有，那时什么感觉呢？</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"80\" />","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/extracted/assets/config/fighter.xml","offset":136,"limit":30,"raw_output":"\t<fighter id=\"renji\" name=\"阿散井·恋次\" comic_type=\"0\">\r\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/renji.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\r\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/renji.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/renji_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/renji_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/renji_w.png\" />\r\n\t\t<contact>\r\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\r\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\r\n\t\t</contact>\r\n\t\t<says>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>我曾经发誓，我说过我一定要救她……|并没有向谁，仅仅是向我的——灵魂而发誓！</say_item>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>在触不到的燎牙上点火，就象不必仰望星星就能解决，|就象不必喊破喉咙就可以一样。</say_item>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>其实我非常害怕，虽然表面好像紧追不舍，随时可以应战了，|实际上，我却连你的影子都不敢踩……|其实，我真的很害怕……</say_item>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>索求斗争……在那之前，所渴望的是什么呢……|呜呼，今夜，再次长啸。</say_item>\r\n\t\t</says>\r\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\r\n\t</fighter>\r\n\t\r\n\t<fighter id=\"kenpachi\" name=\"更木·剑八\" comic_type=\"0\">\r\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/kenpachi.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\r\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/kenpachi.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/kenpachi_w.png\" />\r\n\t\t<contact>\r\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\r\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\r\n\t\t</contact>\r\n\t\t<says>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>来吧、厮杀吧！</say_item>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>不畏惧死，为的是玩乐死亡。</say_item>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>每舍弃自尊一次，我们就越像是野兽。|每扼杀一颗心，我们就远离野兽一步。</say_item>\r\n\t\t\t<say_item>我已经忘了很久了……没有名字的痛苦……|其他人都在叫对方的名字，而自己没有，那时什么感觉呢？</say_item>\r\n\t\t</says>\r\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3\" rate=\"80\" />\n","total_lines":862}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-1e7b88bf-1d78-489d-8dde-6137e8a4729b-18","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"683→\t<fighter id=\"orochimaru\" name=\"大蛇丸\" comic_type=\"1\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/orochimaru.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/orochimaru.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/orochimaru_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/orochimaru_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/orochimaru_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n690→\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>条约只是让对手麻痹的伪装，从现在开始历史将被改写</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>有形的东西迟早会毁灭，无形的东西才会永恒！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>肉体的生命太短暂,太无常</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"killerbee\" name=\"奇拉比\" comic_type=\"1\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/killerbee.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n700→\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/killerbee.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/killerbee_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/killerbee_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/killerbee_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>你这笨蛋，你这混蛋！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>哟！本大爷是最强的！哟！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>哟！你这笨蛋，你这混蛋！哟！......</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n710→\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"pain\" name=\"佩恩\" comic_type=\"1\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/pain.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/pain.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/pain_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/pain_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/pain_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n720→\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>...</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"konan\" name=\"小南\" comic_type=\"1\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/konan.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/konan.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/konan_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/konan_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/konan_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n730→\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>...</say_item>\n\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3\" rate=\"70\" />\n\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"naruto_xianren\" name=\"漩涡·鸣人 仙人\" comic_type=\"1\">\n740→\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/naruto_xr.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/naruto_xr.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/naruto_xr_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/naruto_xr_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/naruto_xr_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>只要你变成全村人都认可的最棒忍者，|你就可以把火影这个名字抢过来！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>我是绝对不会放弃的，因为这就是我的忍道！</say_item>\n\t\t\t<say_item>好！我决定了,我要走一条属于我自己的忍道,|朝着绝对不让自己后悔的道路一直大步的走下去！</say_item>\n750→\t\t</says>\n\t\t<bgm url=\"assets/bgm/minren.mp3\" rate=\"100\" />\n\t</fighter>\n\t\n\t<fighter id=\"naruto_gold\" name=\"漩涡·鸣人 黄金\" comic_type=\"1\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/naruto_xr.swf\" startFrame=\"2\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/naruto_xr.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/naruto_xr_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/naruto_hj_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/naruto_hj_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n760→\t\t</contact>\n\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>只要你变成全村人都认可的最棒忍者，|你就可以把火影这个名字抢过来！</say_item>"}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"ReadFile","FileContent":{"content":"683→\t<fighter id=\"orochimaru\" name=\"大蛇丸\" comic_type=\"1\">\n\t\t<file url=\"assets/fighter/orochimaru.swf\" startFrame=\"1\" />\n\t\t<face url=\"assets/face/orochimaru.png\" big_url=\"assets/face/orochimaru_b.png\" bar_url=\"assets/face/orochimaru_m.png\" win_url=\"assets/face/orochimaru_w.png\" />\n\t\t<contact>\n\t\t\t<friend></friend>\n\t\t\t<enemy></enemy>\n\t\t</contact>\n690→\t\t<says>\n\t\t\t<say_item>条约只是让对手麻痹的伪装，从