{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-fc00e76b-faf1-49fc-ab4e-9aac8ab195e8-67","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"1→# `orihime_fla.织姬全动作_1` — 动作 MC `织姬全动作_1`\n\n一句话目的：角色动作时间轴 `织姬全动作_1`：走/跳/普攻/招/必杀/抓/胜负的脚本帧。通过 `parent.$mc_ctrler` 改允许表、位移、出子弹/攻击体；`$effect_ctrler` 播必杀脸与闪光；偶发 `$fighter_ctrler.moveToTarget`/`setCross`/`justHit`/`doWanKai`/`addHp`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/fighters/orihime/scripts/orihime_fla/织姬全动作_1.as`（816 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n动作总 MC（`FighterCtrler.initMc(this.mc)` 的那份）。根时间轴是 `$fighter_ctrler` 持有者；本 clip 用 **`parent.$mc_ctrler` / `parent.$effect_ctrler` / `parent.$fighter_ctrler`** 回调。[`FighterMC`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterMC.md) `renderChildren` **跳过** 名为 `AImain`、`bdmn`、名字含 `atm` 的子剪辑（当判定盒，不自动 nextFrame）。`AImain` 在 `initHitRange` 里 `gotoAndStop(2)` 扫 [`FighterHitRange`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterHitRange.md) 的 `*mian` 再藏起来。\n10→\n帧脚本几乎全是 [`FighterMcCtrler`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterMcCtrler.md)：`idle` / `endAct` / `setAttack` / `fire` / `addAttacker`。Flash 帧标签本身 **不在** 反编译 AS 里，只留下 `addFrameScript` 数字；下面按帧号分组，标签名从 `setAttack`/`gotoAndPlay`/`loop` 字符串回推。 公开子件：`AImain`, `bdmn`, `bsatm`, `cbs1atm`, `cbs2atm`, `cbs3atm`, `cbs5atm`, `cbsatm`, `k1atm`, `k2atm`, `k3atm`, `kj12atm`, `kj1atm`, `kj2atm`, `sbsatm`, `sh12atm`, `sh1atm`, `sh21atm`, `sh2atm`, `tkatm`, `tzatm`, `zh1atm`, `zh22atm`, `zh2atm`, `zh3atm`, `recoveryBisha`。\n\n井上·织姬 动作 MC。\n\nEmbed `source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol503\"`。"}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"ReadFile","FileContent":{"content":"1→# `orihime_fla.织姬全动作_1` — 动作 MC `织姬全动作_1`\n\n一句话目的：角色动作时间轴 `织姬全动作_1`：走/跳/普攻/招/必杀/抓/胜负的脚本帧。通过 `parent.$mc_ctrler` 改允许表、位移、出子弹/攻击体；`$effect_ctrler` 播必杀脸与闪光；偶发 `$fighter_ctrler.moveToTarget`/`setCross`/`justHit`/`doWanKai`/`addHp`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/fighters/orihime/scripts/orihime_fla/织姬全动作_1.as`（816 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n动作总 MC（`FighterCtrler.initMc(this.mc)` 的那份）。根时间轴是 `$fighter_ctrler` 持有者