{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nQuick fix in mind: change the start_from to `pos + m."}
{"type":"thought","data":"end - 1` to `pos + m."}
{"type":"thought","data":"end()` (skip the comma) and update the regex in `parse_kv_object` to handle `\"key\":value` instead of `key:value`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAlso, the `defineBishaFace` calls are being skipped because the skip logic only looks for `defineAction` — I’ll widen it to `define` + `defineBishaFace` so both lines are captured."}
